second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Christian Holst represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 159, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped into the Atlantic, casting a warm orange glow over the bustling streets of São Paulo, Christian Holst made his way to the Estádio do Canindé.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 160, \"end\": 354, \"text\": \"The Danish-Faroese footballer had called this place home for the past three seasons, and the familiar scent of freshly cut grass and the hum of the crowd's anticipation were like a warm embrace.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 355, \"end\": 440, \"text\": \"As he entered the locker room, the sounds of samba music and laughter filled the air.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 441, \"end\": 597, \"text\": \"His teammates, a diverse bunch of Brazilians, Italians, and a few fellow Scandinavians, were busy getting ready for the evening's match against Corinthians.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 598, \"end\": 784, \"text\": \"Christian exchanged nods and fist bumps with the guys, his Faroese accent still a novelty to some, but his skills on the pitch had long since earned him a place among the team's leaders.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 785, \"end\": 955, \"text\": \"Coach Oliveira, a gruff but fair man with a penchant for dramatic flair, stood at the front of the room, his eyes scanning the room as he delivered his pre-game pep talk.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 956, \"end\": 1003, \"text\": \"\\\"Today, we face our toughest opponent yet, men!\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1004, \"end\": 1056, \"text\": \"But I know we have what it takes to come out on top.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1057, \"end\": 1117, \"text\": \"Christian, I'm counting on you to lead the charge up front.\\\"\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1118, \"end\": 1181, \"text\": \"Christian nodded, his mind already focused on the task at hand.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1182, \"end\": 1277, \"text\": \"He had a reputation for being a clinical finisher, and he intended to add to his tally tonight.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1278, \"end\": 1391, \"text\": \"As he made his way out onto the pitch, the roar of the crowd was like a shot of adrenaline straight to his heart.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1392, \"end\": 1506, \"text\": \"He took his place alongside his strike partner, the mercurial Brazilian winger, Rafael, and the game was underway.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1507, \"end\": 1619, \"text\": \"The next ninety minutes were a blur of sweat, tackles, and near-misses, but Christian's instincts never wavered.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1620, \"end\": 1744, \"text\": \"In the 85th minute, he pounced on a loose ball in the box, his left foot firing the ball into the top corner with precision.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1745, \"end\": 1885, \"text\": \"The stadium erupted, and Christian was mobbed by his teammates as the scoreboard flashed 2-1 in favor of Associação Portuguesa de Desportos.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1886, \"end\": 1985, \"text\": \"As the final whistle blew, Christian grinned, feeling the rush of victory course through his veins.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 79, \"text\": \"Title: The Unlikely Journey of Christian Holst: A Tale of Football and Identity\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 81, \"end\": 295, \"text\": \"In the windswept Faroe Islands, a small archipelago nestled halfway between Iceland and Norway, a young boy named Christian Holst grew up with a passion for football that would take him on an extraordinary journey.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 296, \"end\": 464, \"text\": \"Born to a Danish mother and a Faroese father, Christian's dual heritage would shape his identity and influence his football career in ways he could never have imagined.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 465, \"end\": 643, \"text\": \"As a teenager, Christian's talent on the pitch caught the attention of scouts from Denmark, and he was soon invited to join the youth academy of a prominent Danish football club.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 644, \"end\": 803, \"text\": \"It was a dream come true for the young Faroese-Danish player, but it also meant leaving behind the rugged beauty of his homeland and adapting to a new culture.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 804, \"end\": 1001, \"text\": \"Years of hard work and dedication paid off when Christian earned a spot on the senior team of FC Svendborg, a Danish football club based in the picturesque town of Svendborg on the island of Funen.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1002, \"end\": 1109, \"text\": \"It was a moment of pride for Christian, who had worked tirelessly to prove himself in a competitive league.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1110, \"end\": 1165, \"text\": \"But Christian's journey was not without its challenges.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1166, \"end\": 1284, \"text\": \"As a player of Faroese descent, he faced skepticism from some who doubted his ability to succeed in the Danish league.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1285, \"end\": 1425, \"text\": \"However, Christian's determination and perseverance eventually won over his critics, and he became an integral part of FC Svendborg's squad.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1426, \"end\": 1585, \"text\": \"One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Christian's affiliation with FC Svendborg is his consistent appearance in the team's matchday lineups.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1586, \"end\": 1763, \"text\": \"According to official records, Christian has started in numerous games for the club, scoring crucial goals and providing assists that have helped FC Svendborg secure vital wins.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1764, \"end\": 1890, \"text\": \"Furthermore, Christian's social media profiles and interviews with local media outlets confirm his connection to FC Svendborg.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1891, \"end\": 2083, \"text\": \"In a recent interview with the Svendborg-based newspaper, Fyns Amts Avis, Christian spoke about his experience playing for the club, stating, \\\"FC Svendborg has been like a second family to me.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2084, \"end\": 2192, \"text\": \"The support from the fans and the camaraderie among the players have made my time here truly unforgettable.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2193, \"end\": 2353, \"text\": \"In addition, FC Svendborg's official website and social media channels frequently feature Christian in team photos, match highlights, and promotional materials.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2354, \"end\": 2502, \"text\": \"These visual cues serve as tangible evidence of his involvement with the club, providing a glimpse into his daily life as a professional footballer.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Christian Holst\", \"scope\": \"sports team\", \"claim\": \"Christian Holst plays for the team Associação Portuguesa de Desportos, as indicated by the scoreboard flashing 2-1 in favor of Associação Portuguesa de Desportos after his goal.\", \"answer\": \"Associação Portuguesa de Desportos\", \"quote\": \"The stadium erupted, and Christian was mobbed by his teammates as the scoreboard flashed 2-1 in favor of Associação Portuguesa de Desportos.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Christian Holst\", \"scope\": \"Sports team representation\", \"claim\": \"Christian Holst is an integral part of FC Svendborg's squad and has started in numerous games for the club.\", \"answer\": \"FC Svendborg\", \"quote\": \"Years of hard work and dedication paid off when Christian earned a spot on the senior team of FC Svendborg, a Danish football club based in the picturesque town of Svendborg on the island of Funen. It was a moment of pride for Christian, who had worked tirelessly to prove himself in a competitive league. But Christian's journey was not without its challenges. As a player of Faroese descent, he faced skepticism from some who doubted his ability to succeed in the Danish league. However, Christian's determination and perseverance eventually won over his critics, and he became an integral part of FC Svendborg's squad. One of the most compelling pieces of evidence supporting Christian's affiliation with FC Svendborg is his consistent appearance in the team's matchday lineups. According to official records, Christian has started in numerous games for the club, scoring crucial goals and providing assists that have helped FC Svendborg secure vital wins.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Associação Portuguesa de Desportos\", \"FC Svendborg\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Associação Portuguesa de Desportos\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"FC Svendborg\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
